Metrics List:
- {"name": "container_ulimits_soft", "type": "gauge", "description": "Soft ulimit values for the container root process."}
- {"name": "container_fs_usage_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Number of bytes that are consumed by the container on this filesystem."}
- {"name": "container_spec_memory_limit_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Memory limit for the container."}
- {"name": "container_fs_limit_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Number of bytes that can be consumed by the container on this filesystem."}
- {"name": "container_memory_usage_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Current memory usage in bytes, including all memory regardless of when it was accessed"}
Question: Show the filesystem usage and limit bytes for all containers of the auth service.

Metrics List:
- {"name": "node_softnet_processed_total", "type": "counter", "description": "Number of processed packets"}
- {"name": "container_processes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Number of processes running inside the container."}
- {"name": "node_procs_running", "type": "gauge", "description": "Number of processes in runnable state."}
- {"name": "node_forks_total", "type": "counter", "description": "Total number of forks."}
- {"name": "node_softnet_times_squeezed_total", "type": "counter", "description": "Number of times processing packets ran out of quota"}
- {"name": "node_procs_blocked", "type": "gauge", "description": "Number of processes blocked waiting for I/O to complete."}
- {"name": "node_disk_reads_merged_total", "type": "counter", "description": "The total number of reads merged."}
- {"name": "node_context_switches_total", "type": "counter", "description": "Total number of context switches."}
- {"name": "node_disk_reads_completed_total", "type": "counter", "description": "The total number of reads completed successfully."}
- {"name": "node_disk_read_bytes_total", "type": "counter", "description": "The total number of bytes read successfully."}
Question: Calculates the decrease in the total number of processes currently running in all containers on k8s-node3 compared to that number at the same time one day ago.
